 "sentences": [
  "Meet Cerro Azul, a giant active volcano in Chile.",
  "Its summit reaches 3,788 meters above sea level.",
  "It is responsible for some of South America's largest eruptions.",
  "In 1846, lava created a massive field of 8 to 9 square kilometers.",
  "Later in 1932, a huge explosion blasted 9.5 cubic kilometers of ash into the air.",
  "Its most recent eruption happened in 1967."
